# Pre-engagement checklist

Brought across from the old CSTM `_template`. Fill this before live scanning.

- [ ] Signed RoE / authority to test
- [ ] In-scope and out-of-scope confirmed ([[scope]])
- [ ] Emergency contacts recorded
- [ ] Testing window agreed
- [ ] Classification: {{ classification }}
- [ ] Evidence storage: this vault (`va snap` / `va grab`)
- [ ] `va doctor` clean on the Kali box
- [ ] Intensity chosen (`stealth` for CHECK unless RoE allows more)

Notes: `va notes list` then `va notes show 01` for the full CSTM pre-engagement catalogue.
